  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals, grouped by brand, for pulmonary TB against a microbiological reference standard (adults only, per the caption): 22 Xpert Ultra studies (sensitivity 0.54 to 1.00) and 3 Truenat MTB Plus studies (0.85 to 0.96).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
